<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Bing: site:pcgamer.com Teach My Little Sister How To Drive</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3apcgamer.com+Teach+My+Little+Sister+How+To+Drive</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:pcgamer.com Teach My Little Sister How To Drive</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3apcgamer.com+Teach+My+Little+Sister+How+To+Drive</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How To Drive on Steam</title><link>https://store.steampowered.com/app/3948460/Teach_my_little_sister_how_to_drive/</link><description>TEACH MY LITTLE SISTER HOW TO DRIVE is a chaotic simulation game where you have to teach your sister who's driving on deadly roads. Trapped in the passenger seat, the only thing you can do is to give proper directions to your sister through your voice.</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:28:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Sister How To Drive - Apps on Google Play</title><link>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mathlectureadventure.nothingisbadatall&amp;hl=en-US</link><description>This teach my little sister how to drive voice-controlled driving game turns basic driving practice into an intense challenge where communication, timing, and quick reactions matter...</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:34:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister Drive - Apps on Google Play</title><link>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mecchachameleonmobile.mecchachameleongame&amp;hl=en-US</link><description>Teach My Little Sister How To Drive is a funny driving game about communication, patience, quick thinking, and surviving your sister's first driving lessons. Get in the passenger...</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:25:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How To Drive - gameitchio.com</title><link>https://gameitchio.com/teach-my-little-sister-how-to-drive.html</link><description>Teach My Little Sister How To Drive looks like a cozy car sim, but it plays like a test of nerve where the steering wheel belongs to someone else. You sit in the passenger seat next to your sister, who just got her license, and every turn, brake and lane change has to come out of your mouth instead of your hands.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:19:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>"teach my little sister how to drive"</title><link>https://store.steampowered.com/search?term=teach+my+little+sister+how+to+drive</link><description>2 results match your search. 1 title has been excluded based on your preferences.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:48:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive - Kotaku</title><link>https://kotaku.com/games/teach-my-little-sister-how-to-drive</link><description>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive is a chaotic simulation game where you have to teach your sister who’s driving on deadly roads. Trapped in the passenger seat, the only thing you can do is to...</description><pubDate>Mon, 29 Dec 2025 23:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive - Play Online Without Download</title><link>https://teachmylittlesisterhowtodrive.com/</link><description>The game puts you in the passenger seat as an older sibling teaching your younger sister how to drive. Your objective is to guide her through driving exercises using spoken instructions while avoiding accidents.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:22:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive - itchiogame.com</title><link>https://itchiogame.com/teach-my-little-sister-how-to-drive/</link><description>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive is a driving simulation game where you take responsibility for teaching your younger sister how to operate a car.</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:34:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive - thegameextras.com</title><link>https://thegameextras.com/game/teach-my-little-sister-how-to-drive/</link><description>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive is a chaotic simulation game where you have to teach your sister who's driving on deadly roads. Trapped in the passenger seat, the only thing you can do is to give proper…</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:17:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Teach My Little Sister How to Drive - playgamor.com</title><link>https://playgamor.com/teach-my-little-sister-how-to-drive/</link><description>This is the situation in Teach My Little Sister How to Drive, a simulation game about helping your younger sister learn to drive. You sit beside her as an instructor, but you cannot operate the vehicle yourself.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 04:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>